    description: "docs/audits/README.md says the file converts when the entrypoint-kind registry lands. It did not: (1) the audit-format checker's _REGISTRIES needs canonical and endpoint_shape sections, and a role registry has neither; (2) a DEPRECATE-NO-FOLD row needs an entry-kind emitter scan that producer_coherence does not have; (3) all 49 rows need diagnostic_test and status, and the per-pair leak verdicts have no place in the audit_verdicts format. Either extend the format for a role registry or state in the README that concept_leak_pairs is a permanent sibling format.\n\nEvidence: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/pr7/giron/RESULTS.md. Found while building the entry-kind PR (2026-11-21)."  # a24d
